# first run: change a few clips, save them (flash is TRIBE_FLASH); the second run (save2) must find them
expect dirty 0
tapkey b4
expect trk 4
# track 5 (index 4, 808 CP): a new step 3 and a new level on clip 1 (the first screen is SEL: go to SEQ for the step)
tap SEQ
tapkey w3
expect stepon 3
tap SEL
turn K1 -10
expect level 80
wait 1000
expect dirty 2
leds
# SAVE saves what is changed: the clip on track 5 and the level (a clip that is left unsaved is not kept)
tap SAVE
tap SAVE
wait 300
expect dirty 0
# a clip on another slot: HOME, queue clip 3 (index 2), edit there
tap HOME
tapkey w2
tap PLAY
wait 3000
expect clip 2
tap SEQ
tapkey w5
tapkey w9
expect nsteps 2
wait 1000
expect dirty 1
# SAVE opens the pick: a track key saves that track's clip on screen (the settings and the rest stay), SAVE again saves everything left
tap SAVE
shot save_pick.png
leds
tapkey b4
wait 300
expect dirty 0
tap SAVE
shot save_pick2.png
tap SAVE
wait 300
expect dirty 0
# nothing left: SAVE says so at once and opens nothing
tap SAVE
shot save_none.png
tap PLAY
# the volume, with MASTER given another job (DJ filter), is an ordinary setting: it is saved with GLO
tap GLO
turn K1 1
turn K1 1
turn K1 1
turn K1 1
turn K1 1
turn K1 1
turn K1 1
turn K1 1
turn K1 1
turn K1 1
turn K2 1
expectknob 0 1
turn K1 -1
turn K1 -1
turn K1 -1
turn K1 -1
turn K1 -1
turn K1 -1
turn K1 -1
turn K1 -1
turn K1 -1
turn K2 -10
expectvol 70
tap SAVE
tap GLO
wait 300
expect dirty 0
